# Worldgorger Dragon and Animate Dead, the loop of mandatory actions that is a draw (CR 104.4b, 732.4), with a warped
# Pinnacle Emissary on the battlefield. Warp's delayed ability waits for the end step to exile "this creature", the
# permanent the warped spell became (CR 702.185a); the Dragon exiles the Emissary each round and it returns a new object
# (CR 400.7), one move further from that spell every round. No rule follows it past the first move, so the loop watch
# names that far-gone reference by what it still says (`Obj::became`), and the positions come round again: the game is
# drawn as a loop of passes (docs/rules-exceptions.md, RX-4), long before the event limit.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Animate Dead
Mox Sapphire
Pinnacle Emissary
Swamp
Swamp
Worldgorger Dragon
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Event Limit]
20000

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pinnacle Emissary.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldgorger Dragon)

[Expect]
Result = Draw
DrawReason = MandatoryLoop
Turn = 3
Step = Main1
